From 9b59fcc1fef6eff7074f614e52f145165545ce82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Chinedu Echem <phexaraltd@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:07:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Restructure flat upload into the documented package
 layout

The repository was uploaded as a flat directory, so imports such as
backend.app.retrieval.hybrid could not resolve and files that shared a
name (base.py, __init__.py) had overwritten each other. This restores
the layout described in the README, recreates the lost provider neutral
LLM interface and the connector registry, and keeps the README diagram
source in docs/architecture.mmd.
