From 44cca42afb5508fcef023b1f159a3e8fa5194bf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anthony Chinedu Echem <phexaraltd@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:23:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Evaluation gate, CLI, container stack, monitoring and CI

* Golden set grows to 32 questions with brand names, medication safety,
  paediatric edge cases, extra abstention and out of scope items, and
  labelled tool routing; new metrics for faithfulness, scope accuracy and
  tool routing accuracy, an optional model judge, per category breakdown,
  a markdown report and a threshold gate (evaluation/thresholds.yaml).
* The model sees the question restated with UK generic names.
* root-canon CLI: ask, understand, screen and serve.
* Hardened API image, compose stack with Grafana dashboard and clinical
  safety alert rules, CSP on the interface.
* GitHub Actions: ruff, README style and diagram sync, mypy, pytest with
  coverage on Python 3.11 to 3.13, evaluation gate, frontend build and
  container builds; dependabot, PR template, pre commit hooks.
