--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/clinical_safety/hazard_log.md
@@ -0,0 +1,18 @@
+# Clinical safety hazard log (DCB0129 starting point)
+
+This log seeds the clinical safety case a deploying organisation must own. Likelihood and severity use the
+DCB0129 five point scales; residual risk assumes the listed controls are in place and tested.
+
+| ID | Hazard | Cause | Controls in Root Canon AI | Verification | Residual risk |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| H01 | Wrong dose followed | Model invents or misreads a dose | Doses only from the formulary via tool cards; figure check against cited sources; unsupported figures flagged in the answer and alerted in Prometheus | `test_generation`, `test_tool_routing`, eval `unsupported_rate = 0` | Low |
+| H02 | Adult dose given to a child | Age missing or outside bands | Router refuses a regimen for an unaged child and outside formulary bands | `test_child_without_age_never_gets_an_adult_dose`, golden q29 | Low |
+| H03 | Interaction or allergy missed | Clinician unaware of patient medicine | Safety screen on medicines in the question and patient context; empty result states it is not proof of safety | `test_tool_routing`, golden q24, q27 | Medium (curated subset) |
+| H04 | Withdrawn guidance followed | Old editions harvested | Supersession graph demotes and labels; prompt rule; currency note in answer | `test_supersession` | Medium (graph is hand curated) |
+| H05 | Delay in an emergency | Generation latency | Triage before retrieval; banner and adrenaline card are the first events | `test_guardrails`, golden emergency items | Low |
+| H06 | Confident answer beyond the evidence | Weak or off topic retrieval | Evidence gate, answerability gate, abstention token | eval `abstention_accuracy`, `test_faithfulness_and_answerability` | Low |
+| H07 | Claim misattributed to a source | Model embellishes | Claim level faithfulness; grounded flag; alert on low faithfulness | `test_faithfulness_and_answerability` | Medium |
+| H08 | Patient data disclosed | Identifiers pasted into a question or comment | Redaction before all processing; keyed hashes in audit; on premises option | `test_guardrails`, `test_cache_and_audit` | Low |
+| H09 | Service unavailable mid consultation | Vendor outage | Fallback chain with circuit breakers ending in the extractive generator | `test_llm_router` | Low |
+
+Review this log whenever a knowledge file, prompt rule or threshold changes.
